{"id":"13e183157b0aa40a","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-semiformal-soundness.md","title":"半形式推导的可靠性","display":"thm-semiformal-soundness — 半形式推导的可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-semiformal-soundness","aliases":["18-thm-semiformal-soundness"],"display":"thm-semiformal-soundness — 半形式推导的可靠性","depends_on":["[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Lemma 7.3.6","source_pages":"112","source_pdf_pages":"122","verification_status":"source-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-semiformal-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-semiformal-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-semiformal-soundness — 半形式推导的可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemma 7.3.6"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"112"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"122"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span>；推导关系与满足关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a> 及其算术语言上游。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\rho^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\to\\forall\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\ \\exists F\\in\\Delta\\,(\\mathbb N\\models F[\\Phi]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\rho^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\to\\forall\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\ \\exists F\\in\\Delta\\,(\\mathbb N\\models F[\\Phi]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg D_\\rho^\\alpha(\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg D_\\rho^\\alpha(\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Lemma 7.3.6 的陈述与证明已核对。对 α 归纳。Ax 的相同数值不可能同时落入和不落入同一集；若 Δ 全假，合取分支迫使所有特征实例为真，析取分支迫使某个实例为真，均使其临界公式为真；切分支则同时迫使 F 和其对偶为真，矛盾。空集不存在为真成员，所以不可推导。未把这种标准模型证明称作 PRA 内的有穷一致性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$，$\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)$；推导关系与满足关系取 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]] 及其算术语言上游。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\rho^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\to\\forall\\Phi:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\ \\exists F\\in\\Delta\\,(\\mathbb N\\models F[\\Phi]).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg D_\\rho^\\alpha(\\varnothing).","display":true}],"bytes":1387,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-semiformal-soundness]]"},{"id":"a44f2e4245074d4a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对应 Theorem 7.5.9。书中由 NT 嵌入半形式系统、切消与假原子不可无切推导得到句法一致性，再用命题闭包得到此语义一致性。也可由 [[18-thm-semiformal-soundness]] 排除同时导出 F 和对偶。旧稿写 PRA+TI(<ε₀)⊢Con(PA)，却没有固定记号代码、归纳公式类及一致性句；尤其“所有严格小于 ε₀ 的初段”与“沿 ε₀ 记号序本身归纳”不同。现在保留文件ID并改为原书可逐项核对的元层结论；印刷126页对象化草图尚未发展成本地完整编码定理。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-semiformal-soundness]]"}],"outgoing":["8accc2f8cbc49eab"]}